cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this release when reusing the analysis or evaluation records."
type: software
title: "Unseen-Generator Detection and Processing Robustness of ResNet-50 and CLIP Classifiers: Full-Mirror Refit"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction code and evaluation records for the Tiny-GenImage full-mirror
  study. Saved scores reproduce the CPU baseline. Public grouped decisions,
  rank totals and threshold counts reproduce the ResNet-50 epoch-40
  comparison with the frozen CLIP linear classifier and its robustness analyses.
